"p",null,{"children":"Surhay Design is a web design and development studio in Berlin. We build websites for small and medium-sized companies, freelancers and startups across the German-speaking market — from structure and design through to ongoing maintenance."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Most company websites do not fail for lack of creativity. They fail because nobody decided what a visitor should read first, where they should click, and what happens next. That is why every project starts with a structure, not a moodboard."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We deliberately work without site builders and without bought themes. Not out of ideology, but arithmetic: a theme with thirty plugins is cheaper in month one and more expensive from year two — in load time, in security holes, and in the feeling that you can no longer touch your own website."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"And we say no. If a project belongs at a larger agency, with a shop specialist, or in a simple site builder, you hear that in the first call. It costs us work and costs you nothing."}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"lg:pt-2","data-reveal":"","style":{"--reveal-delay":"0.1s"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border","style":{"borderColor":"var(--line)","boxShadow":"0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent-600)"},"children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/surhay-portrait.webp","alt":"Surhay Design brand mark","width":"960","height":"1120","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","className":"aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover"}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight","children":"Surhay Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-sm text-mute","children":["Web design & development"," · ","Berlin"]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:hallo@surhay.design","className":"link-slide mt-5 inline-block font-semibold","children":"hallo@surhay.design"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"mt-9 grid gap-6 border-t pt-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1","styl